  "description": "Genesys VTT 0.0.163 QA: maps the Quick Dice Pool to the six locked Genesys narrative result symbols: Boost shows Success, Ability shows Advantage, Proficiency shows Triumph, Setback shows Failure, Difficulty shows Threat, and Challenge shows Despair. Uses reusable SVG symbol assets for future chat, result assistant, and Dice Forge integration. Preserves editable Actions and Custom Action workflow, Character Content Registry foundation, Biography status bar, XP/Funds header, two-row Characteristics and Health & Defense snapshot, five-pip Skills, Talent Tier lanes, Rule Engine, Extra Activation UX, and Narrative Results Assistant.",
